    "group": "Daemonic Incursion",
    "summary": "A LEGIONES DAEMONICA unit using Deep Strike may set up more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy model, replacing the more-than-8\" clearance. The placement must be entirely in your Shadow of Chaos or entirely inside the 6\" radius of a single friendly unit from this list: SKARBRAND, ROTIGUS, LORD OF CHANGE, KAIROS FATEWEAVER, GREAT UNCLEAN ONE, SHALAXI HELBANE, BLOODTHIRSTER or KEEPER OF SECRETS. Both units on the second route need a common allegiance keyword among NURGLE, KHORNE, SLAANESH and TZEENTCH.",
